<title>GERMANY: GERMANY'S 1997 RAPESEED HARVEST PUT AT 2.7 MLN T.</title>
<headline>GERMANY'S 1997 RAPESEED HARVEST PUT AT 2.7 MLN T.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's 1997 rapeseed harvest is estimated at 2.7 million tonnes after 1.97 million last year, the ZMP farm price and marketing office said.</p>
<p>It said the yield should be up at 2.94 tonnes per hectare versus 2.31 tph last year.</p>
<p>The previous five-year average for the crop volume was 2.73 million based on an average yield of of 2.81 tph.</p>
<p>Rapeseed harvests are due for completion this week.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
